Stack:
  - Storage      : Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 (ADLS)
  - Ingestion    : Azure Data Factory (ADF) — parameterized pipelines
  - Warehouse    : Azure Synapse Analytics (serverless SQL pool)
  - Transforms   : dbt Core (local)
  - Quality      : dbt tests + ADF validation activity
  - Orchestration: ADF triggers (schedule + tumbling window)
  - Secrets      : Azure Key Vault
  - Monitoring   : Azure Monitor + Log Analytic
  
  
